{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd95 <strong>Command Your Castle on a Dino\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd95</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/bfdf18dbadbb996e9e50f14d729241c3.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/bfdf18dbadbb996e9e50f14d729241c3.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/bfdf18dbadbb996e9e50f14d729241c3.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a <strong>Castle-on-a-Dino</strong> through a world corrupted by the <strong>Voidrift</strong>. Position your <strong>Dino</strong> and its <strong>Kins</strong> across grid-based lands where every move matters. The <strong>Dino</strong> is your base, your lifeline, and your weapon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Deckbuilding Meets Tactics\u00a0\u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/c01951f3d7102a9399775d7a2591dc9d.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/c01951f3d7102a9399775d7a2591dc9d.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/c01951f3d7102a9399775d7a2591dc9d.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strike, defend, harvest, or build with precision as your units move across the map. Every card interacts with terrain, range, and direction.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Rescue and Recruit Kins\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc51</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4b849c8373340b7efa6d9a2c0bc3d24e.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4b849c8373340b7efa6d9a2c0bc3d24e.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4b849c8373340b7efa6d9a2c0bc3d24e.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat corrupted creatures to cleanse and recruit them. Each Kin joins your ranks with a distinct playstyle and deck of cards. Your army and your strategy grow together.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Your Economy Is Your Draw\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udcb0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4f71fbc234b034047a214a53a7adbcb5.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4f71fbc234b034047a214a53a7adbcb5.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4f71fbc234b034047a214a53a7adbcb5.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no random card draw. You buy which cards enter your hand each turn. Coin is both your currency and your tempo, and every purchase shapes your turn and your survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2692\ufe0f</strong> <strong>Shape the Land, Build Your Advantage\u00a0\u2692\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/621b25e91af511de6c9f884d76f93254.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/621b25e91af511de6c9f884d76f93254.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/621b25e91af511de6c9f884d76f93254.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct camps, harvest from the terrain, and reshape the battlefield. Forests can be cleared, lakes tapped, and mountains mined. Every tile can turn into a resource or a risk.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Cleanse the Expanse\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udf0c</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4681538b907031af5aff33b32f5409d5.poster.avif?t=1772106198\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4681538b907031af5aff33b32f5409d5.webm?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352930/extras/4681538b907031af5aff33b32f5409d5.mp4?t=1772106198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul c